{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-21041","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21041-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21041-0","text":"虚无命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21041-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21041-1","text":"——是谁看见他死去？\n——是我，用我的小眼睛！\n——是谁取走他的血？\n——是我，用我的小碟子！\n——是谁为他挖坟墓？\n——是我，用我的凿子和铲子！\n\n看智者机关算尽，王者权欲熏心，英雄自以为是，而愚者欢笑不止——\n「现在，有请花火小姐给我们带来年度大戏——『匹诺康尼惊魂夜』！」","speaker":""}]}
